{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15084","headline":"尚书郎上直闻春漏 · 张少博","name":"尚书郎上直闻春漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建礼含香处，重城待漏辰。\n徐声传凤阙，晓唱辨鸡人。\n银箭听将尽，铜壶滴更新。\n催筹当五夜，移刻及三春。\n杳杳从天远，泠泠出禁频。\n直庐残响曙，肃穆对钩陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张少博","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}